      "key": "SFCC-519",
      "summary": "Store Detail – Page Layout & Template",
      "description": "As a Shopper, I want to view a dedicated page for an individual boutique, so that I can find all the information I need to plan a visit.\nMaster page template for the individual boutique detail page (e.g. /boutique/soho). Establishes the two-column layout on desktop (boutique content and services on the left, opening hours and contact details on the right) and a stacked single-column layout on mobile. This story is the foundational scaffold for all store detail child components and must be created before they can be built or tested.\nSurface: PWA Kit / SFCC storefront page.\nOwner: SFCC/PWA Kit.\nDependency: SFCC-50 (store data model); SFCC-518 (boutique data API).",
