      "summary": "Store Locator – Use Location (Geolocation) Link",
      "description": "As a Shopper, I want to use my current location to find nearby boutiques, so that I can quickly see stores closest to me without typing an address.\n\"Use Location\" link adjacent to the search input on the store locator page. Uses the browser Geolocation API to detect the shopper's current position and re-centre the map and boutique list by proximity. Includes states for: permission granted, permission denied, geolocation unavailable (e.g. unsupported browser), and in-progress (loading indicator).\nSurface: PWA Kit / SFCC store locator page.\nOwner: SFCC/PWA Kit.",
