      "description": "As a Shopper, I want to search for boutiques by entering a location, so that I can find stores near a specific address or city.\nText input field with placeholder text (e.g. \"New York, NY, USA\") on the store locator page. Triggers distance-based filtering of the boutique list and map recentring on submit. Includes a clear/reset state when the input has a value. Degrades gracefully if the geocoding API is unavailable.\nSurface: PWA Kit / SFCC store locator page.\nOwner: SFCC/PWA Kit.\nDependency: Google Maps Geocoding API (confirm whether covered by SFCC-64 or requires a separate integration story).",
