      "key": "SFCC-458",
      "summary": "Find in Boutique – Buffer Stock Exclusion Logic",
      "description": "As a Shopper, I want the Find in Boutique panel to show true boutique stock levels without buffer stock deducted, so that I can see whether a boutique genuinely has the item available to try on or purchase in store.\nBuffer stock is NOT applied to the availability shown in the Find in Boutique modal. This logic story ensures the boutique availability API call bypasses the buffer stock calculation that applies to online PDP availability. SFCC/PWA Kit owned.\nDependencies:\n SFCC-297 (Find in Boutique Button and Slide-In Panel, PDP epic). SFCC-456 (Buffer Stock PDP Availability Display). Buffer stock configuration in SFCC-11.",
