      "key": "SFCC-368",
      "summary": "Order Confirmation – Collection Boutique Map Pin (Collect in Boutique)",
      "description": "As a Shopper who has placed a Collect in Boutique order, I want to see a map showing the pin location of the boutique I will collect from, so that I can easily find the store.\\n\\nThis component appears on the Collect in Boutique order confirmation page below the thank you header (Image 3). It renders as a Google Maps embed with a pin placed at the confirmed collection boutique, labelled with the boutique name (e.g. \"Collect from Zimmermann Bondi Store\"). Unlike the home delivery variant there is no Track Your Order link — instead the map is accompanied by the Collecting From & Estimated Time Ready block below it. Surface: PWA Kit / SFCC order confirmation page. Owned by: SFCC/PWA Kit. Depends on CFD-068. Cross-epic dependency: SFCC-64 (Google Maps API).",
