      "key": "SFCC-356",
      "summary": "Checkout – Collect in Boutique: Store Locator Map (Google Maps)",
      "description": "As a Shopper selecting Collect in Boutique, I want to see an interactive map showing boutique locations near me, so that I can find and select a convenient store.\\n\\nThis component appears on the Collect in Boutique tab below the Recipient Details form (Images 1 and 2). It renders as a \"Store Locators\" section heading with the detected or defaulted region name (e.g. \"Sydney\") displayed alongside a \"Use Location\" link that detects the customer's current location to refocus the map. The map is a Google Maps embed showing boutique pins for stores within the customer's storefront region. Pins are interactive — clicking a pin highlights the corresponding store in the list below. The map is powered by the Google Maps API (see SFCC-64). Surface: PWA Kit / SFCC checkout page. Owned by: SFCC/PWA Kit. Depends on CFD-034. Cross-epic dependency: SFCC-64 (Google Address Autocomplete & Maps API).",
