      "id": "17871",
      "key": "SFCC-35",
      "summary": "Base Pricebook Setup",
      "description": "As a\n Site Admin,\nI want\n price books configured in SFCC Business Manager for all base currencies,\nso that\n each storefront can be assigned a base currency pricebook.\nPrice books are the foundation of all pricing in SFCC — sale pricing, customer group discounts, promotions, and currency display all depend on the correct price book structure being in place first.\nIn SFCC, price books are configured per currency. Each storefront is then pointed at the correct price book as its default. Customer group price books sit as a separate layer, overriding standard prices for qualifying customers regardless of storefront.\nAt least 8 base currency price books for all the storefronts:\nau-aud-list-prices\n (AU)\nuk-gbp-list-prices\n (UK)\neu-eur-list-prices\n (EU Domestic)\neuintl-eur-list-prices\n (EU International)\nme-eur-list-prices\n (Middle East)\nus-usd-list-prices\n (US Domestic)\nusintl-usd-list-prices\n (US International)\nhk-usd-list-prices\n (Hong Kong)\nPlease also refer to this Confluence Page on Storefront default currency setup: \nTSD: Price — SFCC Pricebooks & Global-e - Adobe SFCC - Confluence",
